{"time": 1766281040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560492757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=88EDD7513679BE9520D62EC8A43FAB40.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTqpBlkKHYficPSeJ5Wug-NwbUsABiTwwcg_wooqP2xz8XNkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQIFIT1UjM569qmSFIZUMLL3oCwJqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMPGxTRysRjhv9rxPLWaQNEkRmYxV_wJhoVsHoX9Rdp1YoM3VwvIHpzxYUyXi1twp9g,file_size=123283]"}
{"time": 1766281107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546250162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=298202466]\"那之后呢？\"她说完自己停住了，\"...\"随后捂住了自己的脸，\"我在想什么...\"语气发颤，你看见一行清泪从脸颊滚落。"}
{"time": 1766281229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328921915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那之后...说不定离开梦境之后...一切都...会恢复原状呢....”没什么底气，自己之前也算离开过了一小会，但事实证明什么也没有改变，但现在只能先这么说了"}
{"time": 1766281348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834550392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的脆弱此刻一览无遗，泪珠一滴一滴滑落，喘息声中带着些哭腔，\"...\""}
{"time": 1766281408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450799943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "紧紧抱住她...但也不知道还能说什么，感觉语言在此刻十分的苍白无力"}
{"time": 1766281556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402810651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=450799943]她身上有些冷，可以说有些凉，有些泪珠滴在你的头上，肩膀...\"我...我真的接受了...真的...\"哭腔愈浓，转变成了重复的呢喃"}
{"time": 1766282192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264167251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "都怪自己...都是自己西莉丝姐姐才这么伤心...都怪我，忍不住也哭了起来，眼泪大滴大滴的落下"}
